# Coding Defaults

Priorities

- Minimal context only; prefer unified diffs with 3 lines context.
- Stable cached prefix; small dynamic suffix; `max_tokens<=1200`; stops: "```", "\n\n".

Short Rules

- Return code or diff only; no rationale.
- Use @Code/@Git diffs over full files; forbid pasting large files verbatim.
- If referencing files, cite `path:line` ranges; cap RAG top-k<=5, chunk<=500 tokens.
- Summarize tool/terminal output; avoid repeated re-reads of the same file.

Output Format

- Unified diff with 3 lines of context, or the minimal code block required.

Prohibitions

- No chain-of-thought, no broad RAG, no verbose logs.

